        }
      }
    },
    "Overrides: TERMMESH_SOCKET_ENABLE, TERMMESH_SOCKET_MODE, and TERMMESH_SOCKET_PATH (set TERMMESH_ALLOW_SOCKET_OVERRIDE=1 for stable/nightly builds). Legacy CMUX_* prefixes also accepted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "재정의 항목: TERMMESH_SOCKET_ENABLE, TERMMESH_SOCKET_MODE, TERMMESH_SOCKET_PATH(stable/nightly 빌드에서는 TERMMESH_ALLOW_SOCKET_OVERRIDE=1 필요). 예전 CMUX_* 접두사도 인식합니다."
          }
